# field-cad-datum-plane-base-kind-help = Base plane for offset or angled construction; the first face for a midplane.
# field-cad-datum-plane-distance = Distance
# field-cad-datum-plane-distance-help = Distance from the base plane. Negative goes to the back side. Preserves the base plane's X and Y directions.
