# field-solid-fillet-rows-kind = Radius Type
# field-solid-fillet-rows-kind-help = Constant keeps the same radius along the edge. Chord Length keeps fillet width consistent as face angles change. Variable changes radius from start to end and allows intermediate points. The start is the endpoint with the smaller X, then Y, then Z.
# field-solid-fillet-rows-mid-radii = Intermediate Radii
